# Archived content is pinned byte-for-byte by the sha256 entries in
# Archive/manifest.json, and scripts/check_repo_hygiene.py hashes the file as it
# sits in the working tree. Any end-of-line translation at checkout therefore
# reports drift for every archived text file at once — which is exactly what
# happened on the Windows CI runner, whose default core.autocrlf=true rewrote
# every LF to CRLF. Archived files are immutable blobs, so check them out
# verbatim on every platform.
Archive/** -text
